-- Pacific Cross Vietnam, Travel Insurance Policy, INSURING SECTIONS, Part III: INCIDENTAL
-- COVER, sections 7 to 11 — Travel Delay, Curtailment of Trip or Cancellation Charges,
-- Personal Liability, Incidental Home Country, Rental Car Excess Cover (English src:635-820,
-- Vietnamese src:1738-1942).
--
-- Where the two texts differ in an answer: 9(ii)(h) firearms or weapons (VN-F13); 10 cover
-- "ceases" or "tạm ngưng" (is suspended), and "incidental visits" or "vì lý do đột xuất"
-- (for an unexpected reason) (VN-F17); 11 a "recognized licensed" or a licensed rental company
-- (VN-F18); and, through the definition of Immediate Family Members, 8 and 9(ii)(a) (VN-F6).

§ `Section 7 — Travel Delay`
