-- src:1836 | 6. Nơi cư trú chính ở Nước xuất phát của Người được bảo hiểm
-- src:1837 | bị phá hủy hoàn toàn do hỏa hoạn, lũ lụt, động đất hoặc thiên
-- src:1840 | tai tương tự xảy ra sau khi bắt đầu chuyến đi đòi hỏi Người
-- src:1841 | được bảo hiểm phải có mặt ở nhà trong Thời gian bảo hiểm
-- src:1842 | hoặc trong thời gian của chuyến đi đã định (áp dụng đối với
-- src:1843 | bảo hiểm du lịch Annual Travel).
-- Proviso 4's "(applicable for Annual Travel)" is read as governing only the 14-day limb
-- (fork F-S8P4). For Annual Travel the Cancellation Charges cover runs from 14 days before
-- the scheduled commencement date (AT 5), and proviso 4 excludes any cause arising within
-- 14 days before the scheduled departure date: every cause that arises while that cover is
-- in force is excluded (finding F-S8-ANNUAL; the window is tested on the date the cause
-- arose, fork F-S8WINDOW).
GIVEN c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A section 8 claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `8 — the provisos are met` c claim IF
        "1." ... claim's `the Insured Person abandoned the planned trip, or cut it short by returning to the Country of Residence or Origin`
    AND "3." ... NOT claim's `arises from pregnancy, childbirth or gynecological disease or their sequelae`
    AND "4." ... NOT claim's `the cause arises from conditions or circumstances known to exist on the date of issue of the Policy`
    AND "4." ... NOT `Annual Travel, arising within 14 days before the scheduled departure date`
    WHERE
        scheduled MEANS c's `trip`'s `scheduled departure date on the itinerary`
        `Annual Travel, arising within 14 days before the scheduled departure date` MEANS
                c's `certificate`'s `product` EQUALS `Annual Travel`
            AND claim's `date the cause arose` AT LEAST (scheduled MINUS 14)
            AND claim's `date the cause arose` AT MOST scheduled

GIVEN v     IS A `Text version`
      c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A section 8 claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `8 — the cancellation or curtailment is covered` v c claim IF
        `the general terms let a claim proceed` v c `8 Curtailment of Trip or Cancellation Charges` (claim's `date the cause arose`) (claim's `arose from`)
    AND `the cover is in force for the kind of claim`
    AND `8 — the cause is one the section names, as the provisos shape it` v claim
    AND `8 — the provisos are met` c claim
    WHERE
        `the cover is in force for the kind of claim` MEANS
            CONSIDER claim's `kind`
            WHEN `cancellation of the planned trip` THEN `clause 13 and AT 5 — the Cancellation Charges cover is in force on` c (claim's `date the cause arose`)
            WHEN `curtailment of the trip`          THEN `clause 13 — the cover for the trip is in force on` c (claim's `date the cause arose`)

GIVEN v     IS A `Text version`
      c     IS A `The case`
      claim IS A `A section 8 claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`8 — the amount payable` v c claim MEANS
    IF   `8 — the cancellation or curtailment is covered` v c claim
    THEN min (    claim's `non-refundable prepaid travel and accommodation charges` TIMES claim's `unused portion of those charges, as a fraction`
              PLUS claim's `increased cost of travel by the least expensive alternative, or of reasonable accommodation`)
             (`8 — the limit for` (c's `certificate`'s `plan`))
    ELSE 0

